msgid "Command-line introspection tools"
msgstr "Peralatan introspeksi baris perintah"

msgid "**Source code:** :source:`Lib/asyncio/tools.py`"
msgstr "**Kode sumber:** :source:`Lib/asyncio/tools.py`"

msgid ""
"The :mod:`!asyncio` module can be invoked as a script via ``python -m "
"asyncio`` to inspect the task graph of another running Python process "
"without modifying it or restarting it.  The :mod:`!asyncio.tools` submodule "
"implements this interface."
msgstr ""
"Modul :mod:`!asyncio` dapat dipanggil sebagai skrip melalui ``python -m "
"asyncio`` untuk memeriksa graf task dari proses Python lain yang sedang "
"berjalan tanpa mengubahnya atau memulainya ulang. Submodul :mod:`!"
"asyncio.tools` mengimplementasikan antarmuka ini."

msgid "The following commands inspect the process identified by ``PID``:"
msgstr ""
"Perintah-perintah berikut memeriksa proses yang diidentifikasi oleh ``PID``:"

msgid ""
"$ python -m asyncio pstree [--retries N] PID\n"
"$ python -m asyncio ps [--retries N] PID"
msgstr ""
"$ python -m asyncio pstree [--retries N] PID\n"
"$ python -m asyncio ps [--retries N] PID"

msgid ""
"The commands read the target process state without executing any code in it. "
"They are only available on supported platforms and may require permission to "
"inspect another process.  See the :ref:`permission requirements <permission-"
"requirements>` for details."
msgstr ""
"Perintah-perintah tersebut membaca state proses target tanpa mengeksekusi "
"kode apa pun di dalamnya. Perintah-perintah tersebut hanya tersedia pada "
"platform yang didukung dan mungkin memerlukan izin untuk memeriksa proses "
"lain. Lihat :ref:`persyaratan izin <permission-requirements>` untuk "
"detailnya."

msgid ":ref:`asyncio-graph`"
msgstr ":ref:`asyncio-graph`"

msgid ""
"Programmatic APIs for inspecting the async call graph of a task or future in "
"the current process."
msgstr ""
"API programatik untuk memeriksa graf pemanggilan async dari sebuah task atau "
"future dalam proses saat ini."

msgid ""
"The command examples below use this program, which creates a task hierarchy "
"suitable for inspection and prints its process ID:"
msgstr ""
"Contoh-contoh perintah di bawah menggunakan program ini, yang membuat "
"hierarki task yang cocok untuk diperiksa dan mencetak ID prosesnya:"

msgid "example.py"
msgstr "example.py"

msgid ""
"import asyncio\n"
"import os\n"
"\n"
"async def play(track):\n"
"    await asyncio.sleep(3600)\n"
"    print(f\"🎵 Finished: {track}\")\n"
"\n"
"async def album(name, tracks):\n"
"    async with asyncio.TaskGroup() as tg:\n"
"        for track in tracks:\n"
"            tg.create_task(play(track), name=track)\n"
"\n"
"async def main():\n"
"    print(f\"PID: {os.getpid()}\")\n"
"    async with asyncio.TaskGroup() as tg:\n"
"        tg.create_task(\n"
"            album(\"Sundowning\", [\"TNDNBTG\", \"Levitate\"]),\n"
"            name=\"Sundowning\",\n"
"        )\n"
"        tg.create_task(\n"
"            album(\"TMBTE\", [\"DYWTYLM\", \"Aqua Regia\"]),\n"
"            name=\"TMBTE\",\n"
"        )\n"
"\n"
"asyncio.run(main())"
msgstr ""
"import asyncio\n"
"import os\n"
"\n"
"async def play(track):\n"
"    await asyncio.sleep(3600)\n"
"    print(f\"🎵 Finished: {track}\")\n"
"\n"
"async def album(name, tracks):\n"
"    async with asyncio.TaskGroup() as tg:\n"
"        for track in tracks:\n"
"            tg.create_task(play(track), name=track)\n"
"\n"
"async def main():\n"
"    print(f\"PID: {os.getpid()}\")\n"
"    async with asyncio.TaskGroup() as tg:\n"
"        tg.create_task(\n"
"            album(\"Sundowning\", [\"TNDNBTG\", \"Levitate\"]),\n"
"            name=\"Sundowning\",\n"
"        )\n"
"        tg.create_task(\n"
"            album(\"TMBTE\", [\"DYWTYLM\", \"Aqua Regia\"]),\n"
"            name=\"TMBTE\",\n"
"        )\n"
"\n"
"asyncio.run(main())"

msgid "Run the program in one terminal and leave it running:"
msgstr "Jalankan program dalam satu terminal dan biarkan tetap berjalan:"

msgid ""
"$ python example.py\n"
"PID: 12345"
msgstr ""
"$ python example.py\n"
"PID: 12345"

msgid ""
"Then pass the printed process ID to the commands from another terminal. "
"Thread IDs, task IDs, file paths, and line numbers vary between runs and "
"source layouts."
msgstr ""
"Kemudian berikan ID proses yang tercetak ke perintah-perintah tersebut dari "
"terminal lain. ID thread, ID task, path berkas, dan nomor baris bervariasi "
"antar eksekusi dan tata letak sumber."

msgid "Command-line options"
msgstr "Opsi baris perintah"

msgid ""
"Display task and coroutine relationships as a tree.  Each task is shown with "
"its full coroutine stack, nested under the task (if any) that is awaiting "
"it.  This subcommand is useful for quickly identifying which branch of a "
"task hierarchy is blocked and where in its coroutine stack execution has "
"paused:"
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan hubungan task dan coroutine sebagai pohon. Setiap task "
"ditampilkan beserta tumpukan coroutine lengkapnya, terletak di bawah task "
"(jika ada) yang sedang menunggunya. Subperintah ini berguna untuk "
"mengidentifikasi dengan cepat cabang hierarki task mana yang terblokir dan "
"di mana dalam tumpukan coroutine-nya eksekusi telah berhenti:"

msgid ""
