msgid ""
"If the await graph contains a cycle, ``pstree`` reports an error instead of "
"printing a tree.  A cycle in the await graph is unusual and typically "
"indicates a programming error:"
msgstr ""
"Jika graf await mengandung siklus, ``pstree`` melaporkan galat alih-alih "
"mencetak pohon. Siklus dalam graf await tidak biasa dan biasanya menunjukkan "
"kesalahan pemrograman:"

msgid ""
"$ python -m asyncio pstree 12345\n"
"ERROR: await-graph contains cycles - cannot print a tree!\n"
"\n"
"cycle: Task-2 → Task-3 → Task-2"
msgstr ""
"$ python -m asyncio pstree 12345\n"
"ERROR: await-graph contains cycles - cannot print a tree!\n"
"\n"
"cycle: Task-2 → Task-3 → Task-2"

msgid ""
"Display a flat table of all pending tasks in the process *PID*.  Each row "
"shows the event-loop thread ID, task ID and name, coroutine stack, and the "
"awaiting task's stack, name, and ID, if any."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan tabel datar dari semua task yang tertunda dalam proses *PID*. "
"Setiap baris menampilkan ID thread event loop, ID dan nama task, tumpukan "
"coroutine, serta tumpukan, nama, dan ID task yang menunggu, jika ada."

msgid ""
"This subcommand prints all tasks regardless of whether the await graph "
"contains cycles:"
msgstr ""
"Subperintah ini mencetak semua task terlepas dari apakah graf await "
