msgid ""
"Retry failed attempts to inspect the target process up to *N* times.  This "
"can help when the target process changes while its state is being read."
msgstr ""
"Mencoba ulang upaya yang gagal untuk memeriksa proses target hingga *N* "
"kali. Hal ini dapat membantu ketika proses target berubah sementara state-"
"nya sedang dibaca."
